 "id": "cases/evolve-jintrac-jet-58894",
 "type": "fyo:ScenarioSpecification",
 "title": {
  "zh": "JINTRAC case04 · JET #58894（JETTO+EIRENE，本仓跑不动）",
  "en": "JINTRAC case04 - JET #58894 (JETTO+EIRENE; this repository cannot run it)"
 },
 "note": {
  "zh": "★★这一档**本仓跑不动**，缺的不是数据而是**物理模块**：它的判据是 JETTO 芯部与 EIRENE 中性粒子的**反馈闭合**（电离 / 电荷交换 / 复合与再循环源），而本仓没有中性粒子输运，一个也没有。源文档记：JET #58894，63.38–63.58 s，作业 101612，**12 次 EIRENE 调用**自然跑完。★算例仍然收在这里，因为「缺哪一块」要有个**具名的去处**——`fylite cases --plan` 会把它逐条报出来，而不是让人从缺席里推。★配置里的机器与剖面控件是**本仓的占位**：源文档没有给这一炮的参数，编一份就是假数。",
  "en": "★★This repository CANNOT run this case, and what is missing is not data but a PHYSICS MODULE: its acceptance is the feedback closure between the JETTO core and EIRENE neutrals (ionization / charge exchange / recombination and recycling sources), and this repository has no neutral-particle transport at all. The source records: JET #58894, 63.38-63.58 s, job 101612, completed naturally with 12 EIRENE calls. ★It is kept here so that「缺哪一块」has a NAMED place to be read off: `fylite cases --plan` reports it row by row rather than leaving a reader to infer it from an absence. ★The machine and profile controls are this repository's PLACEHOLDERS: the source gives no parameters for that pulse, and inventing a set would be fabricated data."
 },
 "prescribed_task_kind": "fyo:PhysicsModelingTask",
